This directory stores metadata files as well as config files to set up certain runs.

Models split by GACC for performance reasons. Future work should test whether one national model is better.

Different processes need different configuration arguments, so we organize the config files as such:
* Error analysis config files: has a train/test split to estimate model forecast accuracy. Predict at RAWS locations to compare to sensors. Example config name: `rocky_evaluation.yaml`
* Train/Forecast for Operational Use: no test set, combine all data. Predict over HRRR grid. Example config name: `rocky_operational.yaml`
